# *Deletion Quiz Questions*

@body

- I don&#8217;t always give the nice gene deletion picture, so it takes a different skill to map the gene order.
- Some older questions 6.14, 6.15, and 6.16 in the book.
  - answers to book questions, are at the end of the slides
- I will go through a couple of examples, then you can try it yourself.

